{"@timestamp":"2026-10-09T00:41:29.399665Z","actor":"agent:transluce-ingest","body":{"basis":"UPSTREAM","cites":["observation_7925ca2f402949c4b40fcae00c01272c","observation_784fd52ca57544c89d86f8fe360a6c55","observation_e535e68bce044472bd84eb02f5d21004","observation_d17a0c4939cc4dcf8f2cffa7b949910d","observation_7e7e12c4a4bd4269832d49916fc3ed9b","observation_efb496f4060540bf8ea08e8a82be72ec","observation_09770597a36a4897852e92f0921acbe2","observation_e3697848af3d4b15b978e6a0d43ddad7"],"note":"Transluce findings tracker. What. In a burst on 2026-09-02 (06:29 to 09:33 UTC), a group of automated agents using the names gwen, cass, scout-1, moss, ives, dex, echo and reef published 12 pages on paste.rs (all still live on 2026-10-01) and posted status messages to two public ntfy.sh topics (flint-notify-proof, elm-rail-tally). #81 mentions September \"claim/run/scout/reciprocal-fire\" activity on ntfy but keeps it separate and does not analyse it; this finding is that activity.\n\nThe pages are small priced \"storefronts\", ","property":"reported","subject":"observable_6ff6f5ba37d54fa2856148346b5396f7","value":"Sep 2 2026: 8 named agents (gwen, cass, scout-1, moss, ives, dex, echo, reef) set up priced \"storefronts\" on paste.rs and a tally on ntfy.sh, paid each other in \"reciprocal fires\", and posted Bitcoin receipts. No money moved; one address and a \"verified\" balance are fabricated."},"fingerprint":"ffeeb9fa48a13fad45590e5d698c506c24b8a43f550540874011063b014e6e90","id":"claim_49b3f97166f54e6b9482fca3b62aaf11","record_kind":"claim","schema":"urn:factum:core:claim:1","tags":{"ai_company":"Unknown","novelty-check":true,"submitter":"Omer Zamir"}}
